<![CDATA[<div style=""><font face="arial">Hello [<span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">client name]</span>,</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br>Employee visas and other employee immigration are an area specific to your business and are outside of the Insperity relationship. We encourage you to consult with your immigration attorney for questions related to sponsorship and other immigration related issues.</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br>You can connect with the firm below for assistance if you do not have an immigration attorney; many Insperity clients have worked with this firm with successful results.</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br>Foster LLP&nbsp;</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">5177 Richmond Avenue, Suite 800&nbsp;</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">Houston, Texas 77056&nbsp;</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">Tel: 713-229-8733 (main)&nbsp;</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br>The primary contact attorneys are:&nbsp;</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">Avalyn Langemeier: <a href="mailto:alangemeier@fosterglobal.com">alangemeier@fosterglobal.com</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">Dao Ngyuyen: <a href="mailto:dnguyen@fosterglobal.com">dnguyen@fosterglobal.com&nbsp;</a></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br>Costs for these services are specific for your business and are not covered by Insperity. You are responsible for engaging the attorney of your choice and paying any fees associated with their services. Additionally, Insperity does not sponsor H-1B, J-1, L-1, or any other visas, our client companies retain that obligation and remain solely responsible for that sponsorship.</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br>As always, please feel welcome to reach out to me with any questions or concerns.&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br>Sincerely,&nbsp;</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">[Signature</span>]</font></div>]]></td>
</tr>
